                "description": "Baldwin 6549 Williamsburg Handleset - This traditional handleset made by Baldwin is available in either a wide array of finishes which accentuate the classic beauty of the oval shape. It will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The 6549 Willamsburg Mortise Door Entrance Set is available as either a single cylinder or a dummy set.",
